{"id":9616,"date":"2023-10-18T15:29:13","date_gmt":"2023-10-18T15:29:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?p=9616"},"modified":"2024-08-10T18:22:47","modified_gmt":"2024-08-10T18:22:47","slug":"notice-of-relocation","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/notice-of-relocation\/","title":{"rendered":"Notice of Relocation"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We are excited to announce that the AIMS Ghana Centre has relocated from its previous site to a new location in the heart of Accra. Through our training, activities and initiatives, we continue to better foster and advance excellence in research as the Institute nurtures young talents within the mathematical sciences.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/10\/IMG_9223-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9621\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/10\/IMG_9223-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/10\/IMG_9223-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/10\/IMG_9223-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/10\/IMG_9223-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/10\/IMG_9223-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/10\/IMG_9223-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Our commitment to delivering world-class educational opportunities in the mathematical sciences, and supporting the development of Africa remains unchanged. The new site offers a modern and welcoming environment for learning, better mobility, collaboration, and innovation while allowing AIMS Ghana to expand its capabilities and provide wider reach to students, lecturers, partners, and the general public.